g\" alt=\"\" width=\"null\" height=\"null\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></li><li><img src=\"/images/logos/sunbrella/530-5307608-awning-vector-colorful-sunbrella-logo-transparent-hd-png-removebg-preview.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"null\" height=\"null\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></li><li><img src=\"/images/logos/zodiac/zodiac-new.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"null\" height=\"null\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></li><li><img src=\"/images/logos/sgm/sgm-pool-logo-e1585262761892.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"null\" height=\"null\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></li><li><img src=\"/images/logos/npt/medium-tveat8emx4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"null\" height=\"null\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></li><li><img src=\"/images/logos/pelican-reef/logo-pelican-reef-800x800tiny.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"null\" height=\"null\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></li><li><img src=\"/images/logos/jandy/jandy-logo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"null\" height=\"null\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></li><li><img src=\"/images/logos/irrigreen/irrigreen-logo-black-web.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"null\" height=\"null\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></li><li><img src=\"/images/logos/milestone-p8m6r/image.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"null\" height=\"null\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></li><li><img src=\"/images/logos/gemstone/gemstonelights-newlogo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"null\" height=\"null\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></li><li><img src=\"/images/logos/coyote/coyote-logo-glow.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"null\" height=\"null\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></li><li><img src=\"/images/logos/alumawood/alumawood.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"null\" height=\"null\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></li></ul></div></section>";
const T2 = "<section class=\"svc-intro mm-intro\"><div class=\"mm-marco\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Custom Deck Builders &amp; Contractors in <span class=\"mm-rot\">North &amp; South Florida</span></h2><p class=\"mm-p\">Our deck builders design and construct composite and wood decks across North &amp; South Florida, delivering long-lasting outdoor structures tailored to your home's layout, lifestyle, and Florida's demanding climate.</p><a class=\"mm-flecha\" href=\"/about\">More About Us<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a></div></section>";
const T4 = "<section class=\"mm-gal\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\"><span class=\"mm-rot\">Deck</span> Project Gallery</h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Custom deck builds across Florida — paver, travertine, and composite pool deck designs.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a><a class=\"mm-flecha\" href=\"/gallery\">Project Gallery<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m13 6 6 6-6 6\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-mosaico mm-mosaico--6\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/deck-8/custom-deck-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-08.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Coastal composite deck installation for Florida homes by experienced deck builders and contractors.\"><img src=\"/images/images/deck-8/custom-deck-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-08.jpg\" alt=\"Coastal composite deck installation for Florida homes by experienced deck builders and contractors.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/deck-7/custom-deck-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-07.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Waterfront custom deck with cable railing designed and installed by deck contractors in North &amp; South Florida.\"><img src=\"/images/images/deck-7/custom-deck-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-07.jpg\" alt=\"Waterfront custom deck with cable railing designed and installed by deck contractors in North &amp; South Florida.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/deck-6/custom-deck-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-06.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Modern pool deck installation with premium wood by licensed deck builders serving North &amp; South Florida.\"><img src=\"/images/images/deck-6/custom-deck-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-06.jpg\" alt=\"Modern pool deck installation with premium wood by licensed deck builders serving North &amp; South Florida.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/deck-5/custom-deck-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-05.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Custom wood deck walkway with integrated seating built by residential deck builders in North &amp; South Florida.\"><img src=\"/images/images/deck-5/custom-deck-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-05.jpg\" alt=\"Custom wood deck walkway with integrated seating built by residential deck builders in North &amp; South Florida.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/deck-4/custom-deck-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-04.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Poolside deck construction using durable decking materials by professional deck contractors in North &amp; South Florida.\"><img src=\"/images/images/deck-4/custom-deck-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-04.jpg\" alt=\"Poolside deck construction using durable decking materials by professional deck contractors in North &amp; South Florida.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"mm-celda\" data-mm-foto=\"/images/images/deck-3/custom-deck-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-03.jpg\" aria-label=\"Open photo: Elevated composite deck with railing system installed by expert deck builders in North &amp; South Florida.\"><img src=\"/images/images/deck-3/custom-deck-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-03.jpg\" alt=\"Elevated composite deck with railing system installed by expert deck builders in North &amp; South Florida.\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></button></div><script type=\"application/json\" class=\"mm-gal-mas\">[{\"url\":\"/images/images/deck-2/custom-deck-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-02.jpg\",\"alt\":\"Custom composite deck with pergola structure built by licensed deck contractors serving North & South Florida homes.\"},{\"url\":\"/images/banco/decks/gray-marble-paver-patio-lake-view-florida-01.webp\",\"alt\":\"Wet gray marble paver patio along a stucco house with a royal palm and lake behind.\"},{\"url\":\"/images/banco/decks/gray-marble-paver-driveway-luxury-home-florida-01.webp\",\"alt\":\"Gray marble paver driveway with a mitered edge meeting a landscaped street.\"}]</script></section><div><section class=\"mm-que\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><div class=\"mm-sec-tit\"><p class=\"mm-etiqueta\">What do we do!</p><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Custom Deck Design &amp; Construction Services in Florida</h2></div><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Our team designs and builds composite and wood decks across North &amp; South Florida, combining durability with modern outdoor style.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-que-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-que-col\"><ol class=\"mm-grupos\"><li class=\"mm-grupo mm-grupo--activo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Composite &amp; Treated Wood Decking</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">We frame decks in pressure-treated pine rated for ground contact and surface them in capped composite or sealed wood. Salt air and UV punish fasteners first, so we specify hot-dipped galvanized or stainless hardware and hidden clips that hold through Florida's wet season.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Composite Deck Installation</dt><dd>South Florida builders install composite decks that resist warping, fading, and rot for low‑maintenance living</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Pressure‑Treated Wood Deck Builders</dt><dd>Contractors build pressure‑treated pine decks, sealing and staining for natural beauty</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Multi-Level &amp; Rooftop Decks</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Multi-level decks split the grill, the table and the lounge across platforms instead of crowding one. A rooftop deck sits over living space, so it gets a waterproof membrane, flashed edges, and guardrails and attachments engineered for the design wind speed the code assigns your address, which rises inside Broward's High-Velocity Hurricane Zone.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Multi‑Level Deck Design &amp; Construction</dt><dd>Designers create multi‑level decks for separate cooking, dining, and relaxation zones</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Rooftop Deck Builders</dt><dd>Contractors build rooftop decks that maximize outdoor space with privacy and scenic views</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Pool Decks &amp; Railings</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Around a pool we lay slip-resistant surfaces that stay cool underfoot and slope drainage away from the house. Railings come in powder-coated aluminum, stainless cable or tempered glass, sized and spaced to meet guard and pool-barrier requirements, and set in anchors that resist chlorine and salt.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Pool Deck Installation &amp; Renovation</dt><dd>Installers construct slip‑resistant pool decks and remodel existing surfaces with safe materials</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Deck Railing Installation</dt><dd>Builders install wood, metal, cable, or glass railings to enhance safety and style</dd></div></dl></li><li class=\"mm-grupo\"><h3 class=\"mm-grupo-t\">Lighting, Remodels &amp; Expansions</h3><p class=\"mm-grupo-p\">Low-voltage LEDs in posts, stair risers and rail caps keep the deck usable after dark, on GFCI circuits with wet-rated fixtures that survive Florida humidity. On older decks we open the framing, replace what has rotted, and extend the footprint your setbacks allow.</p><dl class=\"mm-grupo-dl\"><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Deck Lighting Installation</dt><dd>Installers add LED post lights, stair lighting, and recessed fixtures for evening enjoyment</dd></div><div class=\"mm-grupo-i\"><dt>Deck Remodeling &amp; Expansion</dt><dd>North Florida contractors remodel and expand existing decks with new materials and features</dd></div></dl></li></ol><div class=\"mm-datos\"><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+13527403361\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">North Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (352) 740-3361</span></a><a class=\"mm-dato\" href=\"tel:+19549137112\"><span class=\"mm-dato-rot\">South Florida</span><span class=\"mm-dato-val\">+1 (954) 913-7112</span></a></div></div><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-que-medio\"><img class=\"mm-lam-foto\" src=\"/images/images/deck-9/custom-deck-builders-contractors-north-south-florida-09.jpg\" alt=\"Wood deck platform wrapping the rear of a modern Florida home\" width=\"1250\" height=\"698\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"><div class=\"mm-lam-pie\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-n=\"01 / 04\" data-t=\"Composite &amp; Treated Wood Decking\"></div></figure></div></section><section class=\"mm-proc\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Our Custom Deck Build <span class=\"mm-rot\">Process</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">From concept to installation, our deck builders handle permits, material selection, and construction for Florida's demanding coastal and inland climates.</p><div class=\"mm-sec-acc\"><a class=\"mm-btn mm-btn--linea\" href=\"#estimate\">Get a Free Estimate</a></div></div></div><div class=\"mm-proc-cuerpo\"><figure class=\"mm-lam-medio mm-proc-medio\" data-mm-pasos-medio=\"\"><img class=\"mm-lam-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-010/driveway-demolition-skid-steer-base-grading-florida-proceso0.avif\" alt=\"Skid steer grading the base of a demolished driveway in front of a tile-roof house.\" width=\"1600\" height=\"873\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 50%\"><div class=\"mm-lam-pie\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-n=\"01 / 04\" data-t=\"Material Selection &amp; Site Assessment\"></div></figure><ol class=\"mm-pasos\" data-mm-pasos=\"\"><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">1</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-010/driveway-demolition-skid-steer-base-grading-florida-proceso0.avif\" alt=\"Skid steer grading the base of a demolished driveway in front of a tile-roof house.\" width=\"1600\" height=\"873\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 50%\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Material Selection &amp; Site Assessment</h3><p>Comprehensive consultation on decking material options (premium pavers, natural stone, colored concrete, artificial turf) including durability, maintenance, aesthetic appeal, and cost. Site assessment for slope and drainage requirements.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">2</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-007/concrete-slab-site-preparation-sand-pad-aerial-florida-proceso1.avif\" alt=\"Aerial view of a worker compacting a sand pad for a concrete slab on a fenced ranch.\" width=\"1600\" height=\"873\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 50%\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Deck Design &amp; Layout Planning</h3><p>Design of custom deck layout showing material placement patterns, color selections, slope optimization for drainage, and integration with pool/landscape features. 3D renderings provided.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">3</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-010/concrete-paver-driveway-formwork-grid-florida-proceso2.avif\" alt=\"Wood formwork grid laid out for large concrete driveway slabs in front of a tile-roof house.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"655\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 50%\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Site Preparation &amp; Permits</h3><p>Verification of permits for deck expansion, utility line marking, site grading, and compacted base preparation. Confirmation of drainage compliance per Florida Building Code.</p></li><li class=\"mm-paso\"><span class=\"mm-paso-n\">4</span><img class=\"mm-paso-foto\" src=\"/images/obra/obra-048/travertine-pool-deck-french-pattern-rock-border-florida-proceso3.avif\" alt=\"Large French-pattern travertine deck bordered by black lava rock around a pool in progress.\" width=\"1600\" height=\"873\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"object-position:50% 50%\"><h3 class=\"mm-paso-t\">Installation &amp; Finishing</h3><p>Professional installation of selected decking material with proper compaction, alignment, sealing (where applicable), and grouting. Final inspection and customer training on maintenance.</p></li></ol></div></section>";
const T6 = "<section class=\"mm-faq\"><div class=\"mm-sec-cab\"><h2 class=\"mm-h2\">Custom Deck <span class=\"mm-rot\">FAQs</span></h2><div class=\"mm-sec-lado\"><p class=\"mm-p\">Have questions about composite or wood deck installation in Florida? Our licensed deck builders answer the most common questions from Florida homeowners.</p></div></div><div class=\"mm-faq-cuerpo\"><div class=\"mm-faq-lista\"><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Which decking materials are best for Florida homes?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>We use composite decking, pressure-treated lumber, and fiberglass-reinforced boards engineered for long-lasting performance in Florida's heat, humidity, and seasonal rain. These materials resist warping, rot, and pest damage — delivering a surface that maintains its appearance and structural integrity across North and South Florida climates.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>How long does a composite deck last in Florida?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Composite decking resists fading, rot, and pest damage — with many leading products backed by manufacturer warranties of 25 years or more. This extended warranty protection, combined with the material's low maintenance requirements, makes composite an excellent long-term value for Florida homeowners investing in outdoor living upgrades.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Do composite decks stay cool underfoot in Florida heat?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Premium composite decking uses heat-reflective pigments and ventilated profiles that reduce surface temperature compared to standard wood or concrete. Travertine pavers offer a naturally cool surface, making them a popular barefoot-friendly option for Florida pool decks and outdoor living areas exposed to direct South Florida sun.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Is deck maintenance required after installation?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Composite and travertine deck surfaces require minimal maintenance. No sealing, staining, or sanding is needed. Periodic pressure washing and joint re-sanding for paver decks keep surfaces clean. These low-maintenance materials withstand heat, rain, and UV exposure — ideal for Florida homeowners seeking long-term durability with minimal upkeep.</p></div></details><details class=\"mm-faq-item\"><summary><h3>Can you match my home’s existing design style?</h3><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"mm-faq-r\"><p>Yes. Our deck builders fully customize shapes, levels, railing styles, and surface finishes to complement your home's architecture. From straight-line pool decks in travertine or pavers to multi-level composite platforms with built-in lighting, every deck integrates seamlessly with your Florida outdoor living environment.</p></div></details></div><div class=\"mm-faq-lado